<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's Orion Infusion's 96 net up 165.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's Orion Infusion's 96 net up 165.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>			   1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Sales		121.4     vs     94.3</p>
<p>    Gross profit     43.5	vs     31.0</p>
<p>    Net profit	 16.2	vs     6.1</p>
<p>    Dividend     17 taka on 100-taka share vs 15 taka</p>
<p>Note: The Orion Infusion, producing mainly intervenous fluids and injectables, announced its annual results on Monday. The company also offered one rights share for two shares at par to finance an expansion programme.</p>
</text>
